sha256":"1ca30072e354834977d1a268e1d02ad54e8217d7205a74001c87e34ba18c4e0e"},{"asset_ref":"asset:primary:hlm:zhihui:v3.1416:pdf","chapter":24,"classification":{"human_review":"PENDING","method":"DECLARED_PDF_TYPOGRAPHY_V2","reasons":["DECLARED_ANNOTATION_COLOR","WITNESS_LABEL_GLYPH"],"styles":[{"color":15609134,"font":"00-GBK-EUC-H","size":12.15},{"color":15609134,"font":"KaiTi-GBK-EUC-H","size":12.11}]},"dataset_ref":"corpus:front80:v2-candidate","kind":"ZHIPI","locator":{"extraction_ref":"asset:sha256:1c9dee98f867ea07dade7b69b2b8d3987c5046ddb51e1e377c5e306fd26ba900","spans":[{"end":256,"start":223,"unit_ref":"pdf:page:341"}],"transforms":[]},"record_type":"SEGMENT","section_ref":"chapter:24","segment_id":"hlm80:chapter:24:p00005","text":"庚侧此“傻”字加于香菱，则有多少丰神跳于纸上，其娇憨之态可想而知。","text_sha256":"0d1520872348561d218f24f9ae2c3ce4d905676ade96a3cd52e2e4660d68567d"}],"page_navigation":[{"end":223,"exact_span_text":" \n  话说林黛玉正自情思萦逗，缠绵固结之时，忽有人从背后\n击了一掌，说道：“你作什么一个人在这里？”林黛玉倒唬了\n一跳，回头看时，不是别人，却是香菱。林黛玉道：“你这个\n傻","extraction_text_sha256":"d0a485d79da41e1cb65dce6bbddf6a116107a8f661e5f7409a0d742b286e240d","full_pdf":{"asset_ref":"asset:primary:hlm:zhihui:v3.1416:pdf","path":"sources/primary/hongloumeng/zhihui/v3.1416/original.pdf","sha256":"37441da3cb438d1b3eab2b511aa6f1695f309192fa63bea842413ff91655c1d7"},"pdf_page_index_zero_based":340,"physical_page_one_based":341,"start":136,"unit_ref":"pdf:page:341","viewer_fragment":"#page=341"}],"sample":{"reason":"MAIN_TEXT coverage of chapter 24","segment_id":"hlm80:chapter:24:p00004","text_sha256":"1ca30072e354834977d1a268e1d02ad54e8217d7205a74001c87e34ba18c4e0e"},"segment":{"asset_ref":"asset:primary:hlm:zhihui:v3.1416:pdf","chapter":24,"classification":{"human_review":"PENDING","method":"DECLARED_PDF_TYPOGRAPHY_V2","reasons":["DECLARED_MAIN_FONT_SIZE_COLOR"],"styles":[{"color":2301728,"font":"SimSun-GBK-EUC-H","size":15.58}]},"dataset_ref":"corpus:front80:v2-candidate","kind":"MAIN_TEXT","locator":{"extraction_ref":"asset:sha256:1c9dee98f867ea07dade7b69b2b8d3987c5046ddb51e1e377c5e306fd26ba900","spans":[{"end":223,"start":136,"unit_ref":"pdf:page:341"}],"transforms":[]},"record_type":"SEGMENT","section_ref":"chapter:24","segment_id":"hlm80:chapter:24:p00004","text":" \n  话说林黛玉正自情思萦逗，缠绵固结之时，忽有人从背后\n击了一掌，说道：“你作什么一个人在这里？”林黛玉倒唬了\n一跳，回头看时，不是别人，却是香菱。林黛玉道：“你这个\n傻","text_sha256":"1ca30072e354834977d1a268e1d02ad54e8217d7205a74001c87e34ba18c4e0e"}},{"adjacent_segments":[{"asset_ref":"asset:primary:hlm:zhihui:v3.1416:pdf","chapter":25,"classification":{"human_review":"PENDING","method":"DECLARED_PDF_TYPOGRAPHY_V2","reasons":["DECLARED_ANNOTATION_COLOR","WITNESS_LABEL_GLYPH"],"styles":[{"color":1865405,"font":"00-GBK-EUC-H","size":15.61},{"color":1865405,"font":"KaiTi-GBK-EUC-H","size":15.58}]},"dataset_ref":"corpus:front80:v2-candidate","kind":"ZHIPI","locator":{"extraction_ref":"asset:sha256:1c9dee98f867ea07dade7b69b2b8d3987c5046ddb51e1e377c5e306fd26ba900","spans":[{"end":143,"start":64,"unit_ref":"pdf:page:357"}],"transforms":[]},"record_type":"SEGMENT","section_ref":"chapter:25","segment_id":"hlm80:chapter:25:p00003","text":"戚有缘的，推不开；知心的，死不改。纵然是通灵神玉也\n遭尘败。梦里徘徊，醒后疑猜，时时兜底上心来。怕人窥破笑\n盈腮，独自无言偷打咳。这的是、前生造定今生债。 \n","text_sha256":"567bef19135522fa83c7d126cc9cc5e7bc9ebbfe944704a5aa215f154e4f930d"},{"asset_ref":"asset:primary:hlm:zhihui:v3.1416:pdf","chapter":25,"classification":{"human_review":"PENDING","method":"DECLARED_PDF_TYPOGRAPHY_V2","reasons":["DECLARED_MAIN_FONT_SIZE_COLOR"],"styles":[{"color":2301728,"font":"SimSun-GBK-EUC-H","size":15.58}]},"dataset_ref":"corpus:front80:v2-candidate","kind":"MAIN_TEXT","locator":{"extraction_ref":"asset:sha256:1c9dee98f867ea07dade7b69b2b8d3987c5046ddb51e1e377c5e306fd26ba900","spans":[{"end":324,"start":143,"unit_ref":"pdf:page:357"}],"transforms":[]},"record_type":"SEGMENT","section_ref":"chapter:25","segment_id":"hlm80:chapter:25:p00004","text":" \n  话说红玉情思缠绵，忽朦胧睡去，见贾芸要拉他，却回身\n一跑，被门槛子绊了一跤，唬醒过来，方知是梦。因此翻来覆\n去，一夜无眠。至次日天明，方才起来，就有几个丫头来会他\n去打扫屋子地，提洗脸水。这红玉也不梳洗，向镜中胡乱挽了\n一挽头发，洗了洗手，腰内束了一条汗巾子，便来扫地。 \n  谁知宝玉昨儿见了红玉，也就留了心。若要直点名唤他来\n使用，一则怕袭人等寒心；","text_sha256":"b340754aaf20599335d7f456afefd9a06b055ae939f15b3b4ee61a396d006576"},{"asset_ref":"asset:primary:hlm:zhihui:v3.1416:pdf","chapter":25,"classification":{"human_review":"PENDING","method":"DECLARED_PDF_TYPOGRAPHY_V2","reasons":["DECLARED_ANNOTATION_COLOR","WITNESS_LABEL_GLYPH"],"styles":[{"color":15609134,"font":"00-GBK-EUC-H","size":12.15},{"color":15609134,"font":"KaiTi-GBK-EUC-H","size":12.11}]},"dataset_ref":"corpus:front80:v2-candidate","kind":"ZHIPI","locator":{"extraction_ref":"asset:sha256:1c9dee98f867ea07dade7b69b2b8d3987c5046ddb51e1e377c5e306fd26ba900","spans":[{"end":340,"start":324,"unit_ref":"pdf:page:357"}],"transforms":[]},"record_type":"SEGMENT","section_ref":"chapter:25","segment_id":"hlm80:chapter:25:p00005","text":"甲侧是宝玉心中想，不是袭人拈酸。","text_sha256":"8d9755544148aec79bbe2c6a6fbeda5317eb4d834e93f0b87cb97dbeabeaf3ed"}],"page_navigation":[{"end":324,"exact_span_text":" \n  话说红玉情思缠绵，忽朦胧睡去，见贾芸要拉他，却回身\n一跑，被门槛子绊了一跤，唬醒过来，方知是梦。因此翻来覆\n去，一夜无眠。至次日天明，方才起来，就有几个丫头来会他\n去打扫屋子地，提洗脸水。这红玉也不梳洗，向镜中胡乱挽了\n一挽头发，洗了洗手，腰内束了一条汗巾子，便来扫地。 \n  谁知宝玉昨儿见了红玉，也就留了心。若要直点名唤他来\n使用，一则怕袭人等寒心；","extraction_text_sha256":"733b2a5e2d7aeed60f877b397f69212a00cae377ffce5a1c82aae0ee6a878afc","full_pdf":{"asset_ref":"asset:primary:hlm:zhihui:v3.1416:pdf","path":"sources/primary/hongloumeng/zhihui/v3.1416/original.pdf","sha256":"37441da3cb438d1b3eab2b511aa6f1695f309192fa63bea842413ff91655c1d7"},"pdf_page_index_zero_based":356,"physical_page_one_based":357,"start":143,"unit_ref":"pdf:page:357","viewer_fragment":"#page=357"}],"sample":{"reason":"MAIN_TEXT coverage of chapter 25","segment_id":"hlm80:chapter:25:p00004","text_sha256":"b340754aaf20599335d7f456afefd9a06b055ae939f15b3b4ee61a396d006576"},"segment":{"asset_ref":"asset:primary:hlm:zhihui:v3.1416:pdf","chapter":25,"classification":{"human_review":"PENDING","method":"DECLARED_PDF_TYPOGRAPHY_V2","reasons":["DECLARED_MAIN_FONT_SIZE_COLOR"],"styles":[{"color":2301728,"font":"SimSun-GBK-EUC-H","size":15.58}]},"dataset_ref":"corpus:front80:v2-candidate","kind":"MAIN_TEXT","locator":{"extraction_ref":"asset:sha256:1c9dee98f867ea07dade7b69b2b8d3987c5046ddb51e1e377c5e306fd26ba900","spans":[{"end":324,"start":143,"unit_ref":"pdf:page:357"}],"transforms":[]},"record_type":"SEGMENT","section_ref":"chapter:25","segment_id":"hlm80:chapter:25:p00004","text":" \n  话说红玉情思缠绵，忽朦胧睡去，见贾芸要拉他，却回身\n一跑，被门槛子绊了一跤，唬醒过来，方知是梦。因此翻来覆\n去，一夜无眠。至次日天明，方才起来，就有几个丫头来会他\n去打扫屋子地，提洗脸水。这红玉也不梳洗，向镜中胡乱挽了\n一挽头发，洗了洗手，腰内束了一条汗巾子，便来扫地。 \n  谁知宝玉昨儿见了红玉，也就留了心。若要直点名唤他来\n使用，一则怕袭人等寒心；","text_sha256":"b340754aaf20599335d7f456afefd9a06b055ae939f15b3b4ee61a396d006576"}},{"adjacent_segments":[{"asset_ref":"asset:primary:hlm:zhihui:v3.1416:pdf","chapter":26,"classification":{"human_review":"PENDING","method":"DECLARED_PDF_TYPOGRAPHY_V2","reasons":["DECLARED_ANNOTATION_COLOR","WITNESS_LABEL_GLYPH"],"styles":[{"color":1865405,"font":"00-GBK-EUC-H","size":15.61},{"color":1865405,"font":"KaiTi-GBK-EUC-H","size":15.58}]},"dataset_ref":"corpus:front80:v2-candidate","kind":"ZHIPI","locator":{"extraction_ref":"asset:sha256:1c9dee98f867ea07dade7b69b2b8d3987c5046ddb51e1e377c5e306fd26ba900","spans":[{"end":101,"start":62,"unit_ref":"pdf:page:373"}],"transforms":[]},"record_type":"SEGMENT","section_ref":"chapter:26","segment_id":"hlm80:chapter:26:p00003","text":"戚一个是时才得传消息，一个是旧喜化作新歌。真真假假\n事堪疑，哭向花林月底。 \n","text_sha256":"adbbb14483856f94bcebecfd75bd573068cc4f903c3fd28aee3ab045c4bd9f97"},{"asset_ref":"asset:primary:hlm:zhihui:v3.1416:pdf","chapter":26,"classification":{"human_review":"PENDING","method":"DECLARED_PDF_TYPOGRAPHY_V2","reasons":["DECLARED_MAIN_FONT_SIZE_COLOR"],"styles":[{"color":2301728,"font":"SimSun-GBK-EUC-H","size":15.58}]},"dataset_ref":"corpus:front80:v2-candidate","kind":"MAIN_TEXT","locator":{"extraction_ref":"asset:sha256:1c9dee98f867ea07dade7b69b2b8d3987c5046ddb51e1e377c5e306fd26ba900","spans":[{"end":344,"start":101,"unit_ref":"pdf:page:373"}],"transforms":[]},"record_type":"SEGMENT","section_ref":"chapter:26","segment_id":"hlm80:chapter:26:p00004","text":" \n  话说宝玉养过了三十三天之后，不但身体强壮，亦且连脸\n上疮痕平复，仍回大观园内去。这也不在话下。 \n \n  且说近日宝玉病的时节，贾芸带着家下小厮坐更看守，昼\n夜在这里，那红玉同众丫鬟也在这里守着宝玉，彼此相见多日，\n都渐渐的混熟了。那红玉见贾芸手里拿的手帕子，倒像是自己\n从前掉的，待要问他，又不好问的。不料那和尚、道士来过，\n用不着一切男人，贾芸仍种树去了。这件事待要放下，心内又\n放不下，待要问去，又怕人猜疑，正是犹豫不决、神魂不定之\n际，忽听窗外问道：“姐姐在屋里没有？”","text_sha256":"ada09dececde399106e59ade860fc5a8811b04ac4a0512d9cead68e9ed867c8a"},{"asset_ref":"asset:primary:hlm:zhihui:v3.1416:pdf","chapter":26,"classification":{"human_review":"PENDING","method":"DECLARED_PDF_TYPOGRAPHY_V2","reasons":["DECLARED_ANNOTATION_COLOR","WITNESS_LABEL_GLYPH"],"styles":[{"color":15609134,"font":"00-GBK-EUC-H","size":12.15},{"color":15609134,"font":"KaiTi-GBK-EUC-H","size":12.11}]},"dataset_ref":"corpus:front80:v2-candidate","kind":"ZHIPI","locator":{"extraction_ref":"asset:sha256:1c9dee98f867ea07dade7b69b2b8d3987c5046ddb51e1e377c5e306fd26ba900","spans":[{"end":361,"start":344,"unit_ref":"pdf:page:373"}],"transforms":[]},"record_type":"SEGMENT","section_ref":"chapter:26","segment_id":"hlm80:chapter:26:p00005","text":"甲侧岔开正文，却是为正\n文作引。 ","text_sha256":"8ed97d3c3c515eef901f2b7d7c27506ba985081110e10541989b1d1cf1e3e433"}],"page_navigation":[{"end":344,"exact_span_text":" \n  话说宝玉养过了三十三天之后，不但身体强壮，亦且连脸\n上疮痕平复，仍回大观园内去。这也不在话下。 \n \n  且说近日宝玉病的时节，贾芸带着家下小厮坐更看守，昼\n夜在这里，那红玉同众丫鬟也在这里守着宝玉，彼此相见多日，\n都渐渐的混熟了。那红玉见贾芸手里拿的手帕子，倒像是自己\n从前掉的，待要问他，又不好问的。不料那和尚、道士来过，\n用不着一切男人，贾芸仍种树去了。这件事待要放下，心内又\n放不下，待要问去，又怕人猜疑，正是犹豫不决、神魂不定之\n际，忽听窗外问道：“姐姐在屋里没有？”","extraction_text_sha256":"7b8e980823d3727c408599f32344dfd9766cce4d77f33983534bf59caa923f98","full_pdf":{"asset_ref":"asset:primary:hlm:zhihui:v3.1416:pdf","path":"sources/primary/hongloumeng/zhihui/v3.1416/original.pdf","sha256":"37441da3cb438d1b3eab2b511aa6f1695f309192fa63bea842413ff91655c1d7"},"pdf_page_index_zero_based":372,"physical_page_one_based":373,"start":101,"unit_ref":"pdf:page:373","viewer_fragment":"#page=373"}],"sample":{"reason":"MAIN_TEXT coverage of chapter 26","segment_id":"hlm80:chapter:26:p00004","text_sha256":"ada09dececde399106e59ade860fc5a8811b04ac4a0512d9cead68e9ed867c8a"},"segment":{"asset_ref":"asset:primary:hlm:zhihui:v3.1416:pdf","chapter":26,"classification":{"human_review":"PENDING","method":"DECLARED_PDF_TYPOGRAPHY_V2","reasons":["DECLARED_MAIN_FONT_SIZE_COLOR"],"styles":[{"color":2301728,"font":"SimSun-GBK-EUC-H","size":15.58}]},"dataset_ref":"corpus:front80:v2-candidate","kind":"MAIN_TEXT","locator":{"extraction_ref":"asset:sha256:1c9dee98f867ea07dade7b69b2b8d3987c5046ddb51e1e377c5e306fd26ba900","spans":[{"end":344,"start":101,"unit_ref":"pdf:page:373"}],"transforms":[]},"record_type":"SEGMENT","section_ref":"chapter:26","segment_id":"hlm80:chapter:26:p00004","text":" \n  话说宝玉养过了三十三天之后，不但身体强壮，亦且连脸\n上疮痕平复，仍回大观园内去。这也不在话下。 \n \n  且说近日宝玉病的时节，贾芸带着家下小厮坐更看守，昼\n夜在这里，那红玉同众丫鬟也在这里守着宝玉，彼此相见多日，\n都渐渐的混熟了。那红玉见贾芸手里拿的手帕子，倒像是自己\n从前掉的，待要问他，又不好问的。不料那和尚、道士来过，\n用不着一切男人，贾芸仍种树去了。这件事待要放下，心内又\n放不下，待要问去，又怕人猜疑，正是犹豫不决、神魂不定之\n际，忽听窗外问道：“姐姐在屋里没有？”","text_sha256":"ada09dececde399106e59ade860fc5a8811b04ac4a0512d9cead68e9ed867c8a"}},{"adjacent_segments":[{"asset_ref":"asset:primary:hlm:zhihui:v3.1416:pdf","chapter":27,"classification":{"human_review":"PENDING","method":"DECLARED_PDF_TYPOGRAPHY_V2","reasons":["DECLARED_ANNOTATION_COLOR","WITNESS_LABEL_GLYPH"],"styles":[{"color":8032840,"font":"00-GBK-EUC-H","size":15.61},{"color":8032840,"font":"KaiTi-GBK-EUC-H","size":15.58}]},"dataset_ref":"corpus:front80:v2-candidate","kind":"ZHIPI","locator":{"extraction_ref":"asset:sha256:1c9dee98f867ea07dade7b69b2b8d3987c5046ddb51e1e377c5e306fd26ba900","spans":[{"end":113,"start":62,"unit_ref":"pdf:page:388"}],"transforms":[]},"record_type":"SEGMENT","section_ref":"chapter:27","segment_id":"hlm80:chapter:27:p00003","text":"庚《葬花吟》是大观园诸艳之归源小引，故用在饯花日诸\n艳毕集之期。饯花日不论其典与不典，只取其韵耳。 \n","text_sha256":"dc0778380878fb62c404dd2608178fbfa23aada7b2e7de3aed12ca888bb7b98d"},{"asset_ref":"asset:primary:hlm:zhihui:v3.1416:pdf","chapter":27,"classification":{"human_review":"PENDING","method":"DECLARED_PDF_TYPOGRAPHY_V2","reasons":["DECLARED_MAIN_FONT_SIZE_COLOR"],"styles":[{"color":2301728,"font":"SimSun-GBK-EUC-H","size":15.58}]},"dataset_ref":"corpus:front80:v2-candidate","kind":"MAIN_TEXT","locator":{"extraction_ref":"asset:sha256:1c9dee98f867ea07dade7b69b2b8d3987c5046ddb51e1e377c5e306fd26ba900","spans":[{"end":219,"start":113,"unit_ref":"pdf:page:388"}],"transforms":[]},"record_type":"SEGMENT","section_ref":"chapter:27","segment_id":"hlm80:chapter:27:p00004","text":" \n  话说林黛玉正自悲泣，忽听院门响处，只见宝钗出来了，\n宝玉、袭人一群人送了出来。待要上去问着宝玉，又恐当着众\n人问，羞了他倒不便，因而闪过一旁，让宝钗去了，宝玉等进\n去关了门，方转过来，犹望着门洒了几点泪。","text_sha256":"bb1bb841a7e91131243f1250a1850089b9f1f92672c65bbbf3dd4dac41fb1201"},{"asset_ref":"asset:primary:hlm:zhihui:v3.1416:pdf","chapter":27,"classification":{"human_review":"PENDING","method":"DECLARED_PDF_TYPOGRAPHY_V2","reasons":["DECLARED_ANNOTATION_COLOR","WITNESS_LABEL_GLYPH"],"styles":[{"color":15609134,"font":"00-GBK-EUC-H","size":12.15},{"color":15609134,"font":"KaiTi-GBK-EUC-H","size":12.11}]},"dataset_ref":"corpus:front80:v2-candidate","kind":"ZHIPI","locator":{"extraction_ref":"asset:sha256:1c9dee98f867ea07dade7b69b2b8d3987c5046ddb51e1e377c5e306fd26ba900","spans":[{"end":230,"start":219,"unit_ref":"pdf:page:388"}],"transforms":[]},"record_type":"SEGMENT","section_ref":"chapter:27","segment_id":"hlm80:chapter:27:p00005","text":"庚侧四字闪煞颦儿也。\n","text_sha256":"980935fc8696a61a1967c5919e7053872a798bc2038c5da208a409821dfe07c0"}],"page_navigation":[{"end":219,"exact_span_text":" \n  话说林黛玉正自悲泣，忽听院门响处，只见宝钗出来了，\n宝玉、袭人一群人送了出来。待要上去问着宝玉，又恐当着众\n人问，羞了他倒不便，因而闪过一旁，让宝钗去了，宝玉等进\n去关了门，方转过来，犹望着门洒了几点泪。","extraction_text_sha256":"ca38c80c3b54e6e3289b69800a2b268550a57d6b6b1142918a4a5a825c92e502","full_pdf":{"asset_ref":"asset:primary:hlm:zhihui:v3.1416:pdf","path":"sources/primary/hongloumeng/zhihui/v3.1416/original.pdf","sha256":"37441da3cb438d1b3eab2b511aa6f1695f309192fa63bea842413ff91655c1d7"},"pdf_page_index_zero_based":387,"physical_page_one_based":388,"start":113,"unit_ref":"pdf:page:388","viewer_fragment":"#page=388"}],"sample":{"reason":"MAIN_TEXT coverage of chapter 27","segment_id":"hlm80:chapter:27:p00004","text_sha256":"bb1bb841a7e91131243f1250a1850089b9f1f92672c65bbbf3dd4dac41fb1201"},"segment":{"asset_ref":"asset:primary:hlm:zhihui:v3.1416:pdf","chapter":27,"classification":{"human_review":"PENDING","method":"DECLARED_PDF_TYPOGRAPHY_V2","reasons":["DECLARED_MAIN_FONT_SIZE_COLOR"],"styles":[{"color":2301728,"font":"SimSun-GBK-EUC-H","size":15.58}]},"dataset_ref":"corpus:front80:v2-candidate","kind":"MAIN_TEXT","locator":{"extraction_ref":"asset:sha256:1c9dee98f867ea07dade7b69b2b8d3987c5046ddb51e1e377c5e306fd26ba900","spans":[{"end":219,"start":113,"unit_ref":"pdf:page:388"}],"transforms":[]},"record_type":"SEGMENT","section_ref":"chapter:27","segment_id":"hlm80:chapter:27:p00004","text":" \n  话说林黛玉正自悲泣，忽听院门响处，只见宝钗出来了，\n宝玉、袭人一群人送了出来。待要上去问着宝玉，又恐当着众\n人问，羞了他倒不便，因而闪过一旁，让宝钗去了，宝玉等进\n去关了门，方转过来，犹望着门洒了几点泪。","text_sha256":"bb1bb841a7e91131243f1250a1850089b9f1f92672c65bbbf3dd4dac41fb1201"}},{"adjacent_segments":[{"asset_ref":"asset:primary:hlm:zhihui:v3.1416:pdf","chapter":28,"classification":{"human_review":"PENDING","method":"DECLARED_PDF_TYPOGRAPHY_V2","reasons":["DECLARED_ANNOTATION_COLOR","WITNESS_LABEL_GLYPH"],"styles":[{"color":8032840,"font":"00-GBK-EUC-H","size":15.61},{"color":8032840,"font":"KaiTi-GBK-EUC-H","size":15.58},{"color":8032840,"font":"SimSun-GBK-EUC-H","size":15.58}]},"dataset_ref":"corpus:front80:v2-candidate","kind":"ZHIPI","locator":{"extraction_ref":"asset:sha256:1c9dee98f867ea07dade7b69b2b8d3987c5046ddb51e1e377c5e306fd26ba900","spans":[{"end":138,"start":62,"unit_ref":"pdf:page:402"}],"transforms":[]},"record_type":"SEGMENT","section_ref":"chapter:28","segment_id":"hlm80:chapter:28:p00003","text":"庚茜香罗、红麝串写于一回，盖琪官虽系优人，后回与袭\n人供奉玉兄宝卿得同终始者，非泛泛之文也。 \n  自“闻曲”回以后，回回写药方，是白描颦儿添病也。 \n","text_sha256":"7596519bdcb8907ad4b3a744b6787ee3602ca2d76706517819dffa584e9f2503"},{"asset_ref":"asset:primary:hlm:zhihui:v3.1416:pdf","chapter":28,"classification":{"human_review":"PENDING","method":"DECLARED_PDF_TYPOGRAPHY_V2","reasons":["DECLARED_MAIN_FONT_SIZE_COLOR"],"styles":[{"color":2301728,"font":"SimSun-GBK-EUC-H","size":15.58}]},"dataset_ref":"corpus:front80:v2-candidate","kind":"MAIN_TEXT","locator":{"extraction_ref":"asset:sha256:1c9dee98f867ea07dade7b69b2b8d3987c5046ddb51e1e377c5e306fd26ba900","spans":[{"end":452,"start":138,"unit_ref":"pdf:page:402"}],"transforms":[]},"record_type":"SEGMENT","section_ref":"chapter:28","segment_id":"hlm80:chapter:28:p00004","text":" \n  话说林黛玉只因昨夜晴雯不开门一事，错疑在宝玉身上。\n至次日，又可巧遇见饯花之期，正是一腔无明正未发泄，又勾\n起伤春愁思，因把些残花落瓣去掩埋，由不得感花伤己，哭了\n几声，便随口念了几句。不想宝玉在山坡上，听见是黛玉之声，\n先不过是点头感叹；次后听到“侬今葬花人笑痴，他年葬侬知\n是谁”“一朝春尽红颜老，花落人亡两不知”等句，不觉恸倒\n山坡之上，怀里兜的落花撒了一地。试想林黛玉的花颜月貌，\n将来亦到无可寻觅之时，宁不心碎肠断！既黛玉终归无可寻觅\n之时，推之于他人，如宝钗、香菱、袭人等，亦可到无可寻觅\n之时矣。宝钗等终归无可寻觅之时，则自己又安在哉？且自身\n尚不知何在何往，则斯处、斯园、斯花、斯柳，又不知当属谁\n姓矣！","text_sha256":"74cd79d2f476fa375fa94f99fc2281dec04489e3ad7e2e193c05d3ec0442e7e3"},{"asset_ref":"asset:primary:hlm:zhihui:v3.1416:pdf","chapter":28,"classification":{"human_review":"PENDING","method":"DECLARED_PDF_TYPOGRAPHY_V2","reasons":["DECLARED_ANNOTATION_COLOR","WITNESS_LABEL_GLYPH"],"styles":[{"color":15609134,"font":"00-GBK-EUC-H","size":12.15},{"color":15609134,"font":"KaiTi-GBK-EUC-H","size":12.11}]},"dataset_ref":"corpus:front80:v2-candidate","kind":"ZHIPI","locator":{"extraction_ref":"asset:sha256:1c9dee98f867ea07dade7b69b2b8d3987c5046ddb51e1e377c5e306fd26ba900","spans":[{"end":551,"start":452,"unit_ref":"pdf:page:402"}],"transforms":[]},"record_type":"SEGMENT","section_ref":"chapter:28","segment_id":"hlm80:chapter:28:p00005","text":"甲眉不言炼句炼字，辞藻工拙，只想景、想情、想事、想理，反复推求，\n悲伤感慨，乃玉兄一生天性。真颦儿之知己，则实无再有者。昨阻余批《葬花吟》\n之客，嫡是玉兄之化身无疑。余几作点金成铁之人，笨甚笨甚！\n","text_sha256":"b680792058d8c1c801b95b51c9ab767ba3fbf395b40e3df5fd5121e636fe3344"}],"page_navigation":[{"end":452,"exact_span_text":" \n  话说林黛玉只因昨夜晴雯不开门一事，错疑在宝玉身上。\n至次日，又可巧遇见饯花之期，正是一腔无明正未发泄，又勾\n起伤春愁思，因把些残花落瓣去掩埋，由不得感花伤己，哭了\n几声，便随口念了几句。不想宝玉在山坡上，听见是黛玉之声，\n先不过是点头感叹；次后听到“侬今葬花人笑痴，他年葬侬知\n是谁”“一朝春尽红颜老，花落人亡两不知”等句，不觉恸倒\n山坡之上，怀里兜的落花撒了一地。试想林黛玉的花颜月貌，\n将来亦到无可寻觅之时，宁不心碎肠断！既黛玉终归无可寻觅\n之时，推之于他人，如宝钗、香菱、袭人等，亦可到无可寻觅\n之时矣。宝钗等终归无可寻觅之时，则自己又安在哉？且自身\n尚不知何在何往，则斯处、斯园、斯花、斯柳，又不知当属谁\n姓矣！","extraction_text_sha256":"996d42fe6f3ddfddf16a3376f6ac0f86d2466ca9b06bcc0a23e5f9c084daceb0","full_pdf":{"asset_ref":"asset:primary:hlm:zhihui:v3.1416:pdf","path":"sources/primary/hongloumeng/zhihui/v3.1416/original.pdf","sha256":"37441da3cb438d1b3eab2b511aa6f1695f309192fa63bea842413ff91655c1d7"},"pdf_page_index_zero_based":401,"physical_page_one_based":402,"start":138,"unit_ref":"pdf:page:402","viewer_fragment":"#page=402"}],"sample":{"reason":"MAIN_TEXT coverage of chapter 28","segment_id":"hlm80:chapter:28:p00004","text_sha256":"74cd79d2f476fa375fa94f99fc2281dec04489e3ad7e2e193c05d3ec0442e7e3"},"segment":{"asset_ref":"asset:primary:hlm:zhihui:v3.1416:pdf","chapter":28,"classification":{"human_review":"PENDING","method":"DECLARED_PDF_TYPOGRAPHY_V2","reasons":["DECLARED_MAIN_FONT_SIZE_COLOR"],"styles":[{"color":2301728,"font":"SimSun-GBK-EUC-H","size":15.58}]},"dataset_ref":"corpus:front80:v2-candidate","kind":"MAIN_TEXT","locator":{"extraction_ref":"asset:sha256:1c9dee98f867ea07dade7b69b2b8d3987c5046ddb51e1e377c5e306fd26ba900","spans":[{"end":452,"start":138,"unit_ref":"pdf:page:402"}],"transforms":[]},"record_type":"SEGMENT","section_ref":"chapter:28","segment_id":"hlm80:chapter:28:p00004","text":" \n  话说林黛玉只因昨夜晴雯不开门一事，错疑在宝玉身上。\n至次日，又可巧遇见饯花之期，正是一腔无明正未发泄，又勾\n起伤春愁思，因把些残花落瓣去掩埋，由不得感花伤己，哭了\n几声，便随口念了几句。不想宝玉在山坡上，听见是黛玉之声，\n先不过是点头感叹；次后听到“侬今葬花人笑痴，他年葬侬知\n是谁”“一朝春尽红颜老，花落人亡两不知”等句，不觉恸倒\n山坡之上，怀里兜的落花撒了一地。试想林黛玉的花颜月貌，\n将来亦到无可寻觅之时，宁不心碎肠断！既黛玉终归无可寻觅\n之时，推之于他人，如宝钗、香菱、袭人等，亦可到无可寻觅\n之时矣。宝钗等终归无可寻觅之时，则自己又安在哉？且自身\n尚不知何在何往，则斯处、斯园、斯花、斯柳，又不知当属谁\n姓矣！","text_sha256":"74cd79d2f476fa375fa94f99fc2281dec04489e3ad7e2e193c05d3ec0442e7e3"}},{"adjacent_segments":[{"asset_ref":"asset:primary:hlm:zhihui:v3.1416:pdf","chapter":29,"classification":{"human_review":"PENDING","method":"DECLARED_PDF_TYPOGRAPHY_V2","reasons":["DECLARED_ANNOTATION_COLOR","WITNESS_LABEL_GLYPH"],"styles":[{"color":8032840,"font":"00-GBK-EUC-H","size":15.61},{"color":8032840,"font":"KaiTi-GBK-EUC-H","size":15.58},{"color":8032840,"font":"SimSun-GBK-EUC-H","size":15.58}]},"dataset_ref":"corpus:front80:v2-candidate","kind":"ZHIPI","locator":{"extraction_ref":"asset:sha256:1c9dee98f867ea07dade7b69b2b8d3987c5046ddb51e1e377c5e306fd26ba900","spans":[{"end":147,"start":62,"unit_ref":"pdf:page:420"}],"transforms":[]},"record_type":"SEGMENT","section_ref":"chapter:29","segment_id":"hlm80:chapter:29:p00003","text":"庚清虚观，贾母、凤姐原意大适意大快乐，偏写出多少不\n适意事来，此亦天然至情至理必有之事。 \n  二玉心事，此回大书，是难了割，却用太君一言以定，是\n道悉通部书之大旨。 \n","text_sha256":"3936407e0873818c3a96944d52e11d352558db935aac6b66295c7f8f0bd2373a"},{"asset_ref":"asset:primary:hlm:zhihui:v3.1416:pdf","chapter":29,"classification":{"human_review":"PENDING","method":"DECLARED_PDF_TYPOGRAPHY_V2","reasons":["DECLARED_MAIN_FONT_SIZE_COLOR"],"styles":[{"color":2301728,"font":"SimSun-GBK-EUC-H","size":15.58}]},"dataset_ref":"corpus:front80:v2-candidate","kind":"MAIN_TEXT","locator":{"extraction_ref":"asset:sha256:1c9dee98f867ea07dade7b69b2b8d3987c5046ddb51e1e377c5e306fd26ba900","spans":[{"end":495,"start":147,"unit_ref":"pdf:page:420"}],"transforms":[]},"record_type":"SEGMENT","section_ref":"chapter:29","segment_id":"hlm80:chapter:29:p00004","text":" \n  话说宝玉正自发怔，不想黛玉将手帕子甩了来，正碰在眼\n睛上，倒唬了一跳，问是谁。林黛玉摇着头儿笑道：“不敢，\n是我失了手。因为宝姐姐要看呆雁，我比给他看，不想失了手。”\n宝玉揉着眼睛，待要说什么，又不好说的。 \n \n  一时，凤姐儿来了，因说起初一日在清虚观打醮的事来，\n遂约着宝钗、宝玉、黛玉等看戏去。宝钗笑道：“罢，罢，怪\n热的。什么没看过的戏，我就不去了。”凤姐儿道：“他们那\n里凉快，两边又有楼。咱们要去，我头几天打发人去，把那些\n道士都赶出去，把楼打扫干净，挂起帘子来，一个闲人不许放\n进庙去，才是好呢。我已经回了太太了，你们不去我去。这些\n日子也闷的很了。家里唱动戏，我又不得舒舒服服的看。” \n  贾母听说，笑道：“既这么着，我同你去。”凤姐听说，\n笑道：“老祖宗也去，干净\n","text_sha256":"082ea27320adeca9cfd17ebfea4f302db38cbbeb4a778c7ed5371010d8c16755"},{"asset_ref":"asset:primary:hlm:zhihui:v3.1416:pdf","chapter":29,"classification":{"human_review":"PENDING","method":"DECLARED_PDF_TYPOGRAPHY_V2","reasons":["HEADER_FOOTNOTE_TITLE_OR_COLLATION_MARKER"],"styles":[{"color